{"seq":25,"slug":"mobile-push-notification-engineering","title":"移动端推送通知工程","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 移动端推送通知工程\n\n移动推送通知是连接应用与用户的实时消息管道——从系统级协议到业务运营，涉及的工程细节远比\"发一条消息\"复杂。本 hub 将推送通知作为一个完整的工程领域来处理，覆盖从底层协议对接到上层增长运营的全链路知识。\n\n本 hub 与同 category 下兄弟 hub 的分工如下：`ios-development` / `android-development` 关注各平台通用开发能力；`mobile-cicd-release` 聚焦构建与发布流水线；`mobile-security` 处理安全防护。本 hub 则专注于推送通知这一垂直切面——协议层、平台服务、客户端实现、送达可靠性与运营策略的深度工程实践。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n建议按章节顺序阅读：\n\n1. **基础篇**：理解推送架构全貌、三大平台服务（APNs/FCM/HMS）差异、通知渠道分类体系。这是后续所有内容的基石。\n2. **实现篇**：掌握富媒体通知、静默推送与后台唤醒、本地定时通知等客户端关键技术。\n3. **送达可靠性篇**：深入送达率优化、Token 生命周期管理、多通道降级策略，解决\"消息发了但用户没收到\"的核心痛点。\n4. **运营篇**：学习分群精准推送、A/B 测试与时机优化、推送数据分析，将技术能力转化为业务增长。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 熟悉 iOS 或 Android 至少一个平台的应用开发基础\n- 理解 HTTP/2 协议与 TLS 基本概念\n- 了解 JSON payload 结构与 RESTful API 调用方式\n- 对移动应用生命周期（前台/后台/终止）有基本认知\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"推送基础：协议、平台与渠道","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"push-architecture-protocols","title":"推送架构与协议","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/fundamentals/push-architecture-protocols"},{"seq":2,"slug":"apns-fcm-hms","title":"APNs、FCM 与 HMS 推送","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/fundamentals/apns-fcm-hms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"notification-channels-categories","title":"通知渠道与分类管理","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/fundamentals/notification-channels-categories"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation","title":"推送实现：富媒体、静默唤醒与本地调度","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rich-notification-media","title":"富媒体通知与交互","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/implementation/rich-notification-media"},{"seq":2,"slug":"silent-push-background","title":"静默推送与后台唤醒","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/implementation/silent-push-background"},{"seq":3,"slug":"local-scheduled-notifications","title":"本地通知与定时调度","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/implementation/local-scheduled-notifications"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"delivery-reliability","title":"送达可靠性：优化、Token 与多通道","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/delivery-reliability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"delivery-optimization","title":"送达率优化","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/delivery-reliability/delivery-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"token-management-lifecycle","title":"Token 管理与生命周期","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/delivery-reliability/token-management-lifecycle"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fallback-multi-channel","title":"降级与多通道策略","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/delivery-reliability/fallback-multi-channel"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"engagement-operations","title":"推送运营：分群、时机与数据驱动","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/engagement-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"segmentation-targeting","title":"用户分群与精准推送","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/engagement-operations/segmentation-targeting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ab-testing-timing","title":"A/B 测试与推送时机","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/engagement-operations/ab-testing-timing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"notification-analytics-metrics","title":"推送数据分析与指标","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/engagement-operations/notification-analytics-metrics"}]}]}